          </table:table-row>
          <table:table-row>
            <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="LabelCell"><text:p>수용 장소 정보</text:p><text:p>(이송처 주소)</text:p></table:table-cell>
            <table:covered-table-cell/>
            <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          </table:table-row>
          <table:table-row>
            <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="TallCell"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Bold">기타 특기사항</text:span> (자격증 등을 가지고 협력할 수 있는 분은 성함과 내용을 기재해 주십시오.)</text:p><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell>
            <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          </table:table-row>
        </table:table-rows>
